\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1. Thou Mighty God, Holy Trinity,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj The Father, Son and Holy Ghost.
\par In your Holy name I was baptised
\par and I was made one of your sons,
\par Your children who were born from Heav'n
\par and I am for the Holy Ghost.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  You've truly made me one of your sons,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj and that have made you my Father.
\par The death of your son takes all my sins;
\par My Master Jesus, has saved me!
\par In all my life and all my strength
\par Keep me renewed by your spirit.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. I come with shyness, fear and respect
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 that makes me aim to be your son,
\par You teach me only, that you are mine;
\par And I am thine for evermore.
\par I shun all works of the devil
\par Until the time that I will die.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  My God and Lord, thou art most honest,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And thou covenant stands so firm.
\par I am the poorest and sinful man,
\par And too afraid to commit sin.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 So then if I am backsliding
\par Rescue me, let me be your son.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5. The whole of my being and my spirit
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj and my soul I give to you Lord,
\par give me the strength of telling the truth,
\par And impart into me your mind.
\par Your precious blood you shared for me
\par shall cleanse me for the sake of love.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.   You, king of darkness clear from my sight;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 I have nothing to do with you.
\par I feel so guilty by my conscience,
\par but the blood of Christ makes it clean.
\par The sins of this earth, go away;
\par In my God I renounce them all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   7. Let me be all that stable in mind
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Father, the Son and Holy Ghost.
\par I do believe in all your promise
\par Until the time I pass away.
\par Oh in my death or if alive,
\par \pard      I'll serve you always O, my God.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

